ifodump
------------------------------------------
Dump iFO data from dvd disk

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libdvdread8-7.1.1-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libdvdread-devel-7.1.1-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://sourceforge.net/projects/dvd/files/ifodump/

Canonical download:
  mirror://sourceforge/dvd/ifodump-0.0.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack ifodump-0.0.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./ifodump-0.0.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/ifodump-0.0.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/ifodump-0.0.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(ifodump)
  /usr/bin/ifo_dump.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/ifodump.README
  /usr/share/doc/ifodump/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/ifodump/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/ifodump/NEWS
  /usr/share/doc/ifodump/README
  /usr/share/doc/ifodump/TODO

